    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564-a1">

                <pb facs="1026" n="932" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg932"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 216.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Chacaltana to Mr.
                            Buck.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Relations</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1887-03-09"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 9,
                    1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Complying with a request mane to this
                    ministry by the prefect of this department, I take the liberty of asking your
                    excellency to be pleased to forward me one list of the citizens of the nation
                    which your excellency so worthily represents, who are domiciled in this capital,
                    specifying the name, age, profession, street, and number of the house in which
                    each one lives, including in it those from twenty-five to sixty years old, and
                    another list, including in it those from seventeen to twenty-one years old, with
                    the same specifications.</p>
                <p>I avail, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cesáreo
                    Chacaltana.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
